* *"I am currently taking calcium and vitamin D. I have these listed as my management for Type 2 diabetes, but I understand these are typically for bone health. Can we review my actual diabetes medications?"*
* *"I am taking 20mg of furosemide. Could this or any of my other medications be contributing to my shortness of breath or frequent joint pain?"*

