*   *"I've been experiencing shortness of breath. Could my current dose of furosemide (20mg) or my other supplements be contributing to this, or is it more likely related to my heart or lung health?"* (Note: Furosemide is a diuretic often used to treat fluid retention related to heart, kidney, or liver issues, which can sometimes tie into breathing difficulties).
